WEBVTT

01:26.750 --> 01:29.700
[Glory]

01:30.620 --> 01:32.979
[Episode 12]

01:34.150 --> 01:34.789
Since you've said you want to

01:34.789 --> 01:35.710
be my wife,

01:37.120 --> 01:38.580
will it last for one night,

01:39.000 --> 01:39.789
one month

01:41.000 --> 01:42.070
or a lifetime?

01:44.280 --> 01:45.070
Well...

02:09.680 --> 02:11.140
You're such a strange man.

02:11.630 --> 02:13.430
As long as we're happy together,

02:13.630 --> 02:16.120
why do you care whether it'll
last for one night, one month

02:16.120 --> 02:17.030
or a lifetime?

02:18.240 --> 02:20.120
Tea seeds
will be planted in a tea plantation.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.579
No matter how skilled I am,

02:21.770 --> 02:22.660
I still can't guarantee

02:22.660 --> 02:24.910
every seed can grow into a tree
for plucking leaves.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.630
As for how long we can be married,

02:26.630 --> 02:28.400
even if I make a promise,
it still doesn't count.

02:28.400 --> 02:29.630
It's all up to fate.

02:32.000 --> 02:35.150
These words don't sound like
what a good person would say.

02:35.150 --> 02:37.550
And I definitely won't
fall into your trap.

02:38.360 --> 02:40.360
If you don't give me a definite time,

02:40.590 --> 02:42.790
I'm sorry but I won't follow your order.

02:43.630 --> 02:45.630
You're in the Xinfang Pavilion now.

02:45.710 --> 02:47.150
Mr. Yan and and Mr. Bai

02:47.400 --> 02:48.260
live next door.

02:48.540 --> 02:49.579
Wen is here, too.

02:50.150 --> 02:52.280
If you still disagree
despite all my coaxing,

02:52.280 --> 02:53.870
do I have to force you?

02:54.400 --> 02:57.329
If this doesn't work,
I can always find someone else.

03:07.140 --> 03:09.070
You're not allowed to go anywhere.

03:11.410 --> 03:13.690
What? Have you changed your mind, Mr. Lu?

03:12.770 --> 03:14.170
♪ Stars and the moon descended ♪

03:14.430 --> 03:19.579
♪ Falling Into the mortal world
to make flowers wither and hearts break ♪

03:19.720 --> 03:21.470
♪ How persistent ♪

03:21.490 --> 03:26.100
♪ How can such a fleeting grace
be forgotten? ♪

03:26.780 --> 03:28.610
♪ Beacon fires rose high ♪

03:28.630 --> 03:34.340
♪ With one more dance,
the music is over and people are gone ♪

03:28.960 --> 03:30.020
It's late at night.

03:30.030 --> 03:31.430
Who else do you want to disturb?

03:31.430 --> 03:33.030
Let's just sleep like this tonight.

03:33.030 --> 03:34.710
Let's wait
till you give me a definite answer,

03:34.710 --> 03:35.660
and then we can be husband and wife.

03:35.660 --> 03:40.140
♪ We found another crescent moon ♪

03:55.220 --> 03:56.190
I have my pride.

03:56.910 --> 03:58.170
Please don't force me.

03:58.910 --> 04:00.110
You're really a fool.

04:10.740 --> 04:15.910
♪ The moon shines on the desolate hills ♪

04:16.200 --> 04:22.660
♪ Let's lie in the sea of grass
to herd cows and sheep♪

04:24.520 --> 04:29.410
♪ Those thoughts turned into wine,
which I drank with sorrow ♪

04:30.310 --> 04:36.550
♪ Feeling lost, I went into my dreams
to look for the past ♪

04:37.340 --> 04:39.090
♪ Stars and the moon descended ♪

04:39.110 --> 04:44.110
♪ Falling Into the mortal world
to make flowers wither and hearts break ♪

04:44.450 --> 04:46.040
♪ How persistent ♪

04:46.070 --> 04:51.280
♪ How can such a fleeting grace
be forgotten? ♪

04:51.500 --> 04:53.159
♪ Beacon fires rose high ♪

04:53.180 --> 04:59.090
♪ With one more dance,
the music is over and people are gone ♪

05:00.340 --> 05:04.590
♪ We found another crescent moon ♪

05:36.040 --> 05:36.840
Young Master?

05:48.920 --> 05:50.310
Murder! Murder!

05:50.510 --> 05:51.680
The young master has been murdered!

05:51.680 --> 05:52.800
Come quickly!

06:06.360 --> 06:08.820
You're not in your room
early in the morning.

06:21.680 --> 06:22.390
Mr. Bai.

06:23.390 --> 06:24.720
Where have you been?

06:26.750 --> 06:28.000
I woke up at midnight

06:28.600 --> 06:30.480
and couldn't sleep due to restlessness.

06:30.480 --> 06:32.070
I thought I'd take a walk around

06:32.070 --> 06:32.680
and go to

06:33.040 --> 06:34.480
that pine tree behind the courtyard

06:34.480 --> 06:35.470
to sit for a while.

06:35.470 --> 06:36.470
Unexpectedly...

06:38.680 --> 06:41.409
Unexpectedly,
I fell asleep leaning against it.

06:41.750 --> 06:44.280
I'm sorry
for being such a fool in front of you.

06:44.310 --> 06:45.000
Mr. Bai.

06:46.720 --> 06:47.650
Just ignore him.

06:48.240 --> 06:50.170
He always scolds whoever he meets.

06:50.250 --> 06:52.180
He's suspicious and full of anger.

06:52.360 --> 06:54.220
He's just taking it out on others.

07:19.430 --> 07:20.040
Shanbao.

07:27.140 --> 07:28.460
That is Mr. Lu's room.

07:43.159 --> 07:43.960
Young Master!

07:44.040 --> 07:44.840
Young Master!

07:44.950 --> 07:45.950
Yang Dingchen...

07:46.560 --> 07:47.310
He's dead.

08:01.600 --> 08:03.040
Grandmother selected a husband for Shanbao

08:03.040 --> 08:04.370
out of good intentions.

08:04.800 --> 08:05.480
Besides,

08:05.480 --> 08:08.070
the Yang family has been on friendly terms
with our family.

08:08.070 --> 08:09.630
Even if Shanbao had been so picky that

08:09.630 --> 08:10.760
she didn't like him,

08:10.950 --> 08:12.870
she still should have treated him
with courtesy

08:12.870 --> 08:14.390
and politely seen him off

08:14.870 --> 08:17.070
in order to save face for both families.

08:17.510 --> 08:20.390
However, Shanbao was so arrogant and rude,

08:20.590 --> 08:22.560
treating her suitors
as if they didn't exist,

08:22.560 --> 08:23.710
ordering them around

08:23.710 --> 08:25.110
and offending everyone.

08:25.430 --> 08:27.360
She agreed to the marriage herself

08:27.360 --> 08:29.420
but changed her mind for some reason,

08:29.800 --> 08:31.950
leaving Mr. Yang alone
in the bridal chamber.

08:31.950 --> 08:34.409
That's why all this trouble
has been caused.

08:35.320 --> 08:37.520
What nonsense are you talking, Yunyin?

08:37.600 --> 08:39.510
Yang Dingchen occupied the Qilan Garden

08:39.510 --> 08:41.549
and set the wedding date
without permission.

08:41.549 --> 08:43.080
Did he inform Grandmother?

08:43.230 --> 08:45.360
And did he get permission from anyone?

08:45.480 --> 08:46.600
He was clearly a scoundrel,

08:46.600 --> 08:47.440
who we couldn't hit or scold.

08:47.440 --> 08:49.030
Couldn't we at least avoid him?

08:49.030 --> 08:51.080
Since he came to the Rong family,

08:51.510 --> 08:54.270
he has been domineering,
arrogant and jealous.

08:54.630 --> 08:56.120
Every young master in the Xinfang Pavilion

08:56.120 --> 08:56.790
was once

08:56.790 --> 08:58.190
victimized by his plots.

08:58.620 --> 09:00.240
He made too many enemies
and got poisoned to death.

09:00.240 --> 09:02.100
He could blame no one but himself.

09:07.720 --> 09:09.980
But he died in the Qilan Garden after all.

09:10.150 --> 09:11.610
I'm afraid the Yang family

09:11.960 --> 09:13.510
won't let us off so easily.

09:19.550 --> 09:21.080
I've warned you before.

09:21.690 --> 09:23.000
You rejected the one who was gentle,

09:23.000 --> 09:24.550
modest, kind and generous.

09:24.590 --> 09:25.920
Instead, you chose him.

09:27.480 --> 09:29.280
No wonder trouble has occurred.

09:36.720 --> 09:39.450
Old Madam,
some men from the Yang family are here.

09:45.240 --> 09:46.770
Grandmother, don't worry.

09:46.870 --> 09:47.790
I will handle

09:48.200 --> 09:49.600
my own affairs properly.

09:59.240 --> 10:00.320
Oh, my nephew!

10:01.430 --> 10:03.310
My dear nephew!

10:03.790 --> 10:06.120
I'm late!

10:06.980 --> 10:09.110
[Yang Jisheng]

10:07.040 --> 10:09.010
-I'm late!
-Father.

10:10.630 --> 10:12.510
My father
suddenly heard about my cousin's death.

10:12.510 --> 10:14.040
He was overwhelmed by grief

10:14.120 --> 10:15.450
and lost his composure.

10:15.840 --> 10:16.960
Lady Shanbao,

10:19.000 --> 10:20.130
please forgive him.

10:21.580 --> 10:22.550
What? Well...

10:21.970 --> 10:23.300
[Yang Yitang]

10:27.840 --> 10:28.300
Well...

10:28.750 --> 10:30.030
Everyone, don't panic.

10:30.030 --> 10:30.760
Don't panic.

10:31.150 --> 10:32.240
It's my fault

10:32.510 --> 10:34.200
for not explaining this in advance.

10:34.200 --> 10:36.510
Yitang and my late nephew

10:36.510 --> 10:38.170
were actually twin brothers.

10:38.240 --> 10:38.840
But when he was a kid,

10:38.840 --> 10:40.320
he was adopted
into my branch of the family

10:40.320 --> 10:41.480
and became my son.

10:41.990 --> 10:44.390
The one who died
was his twin elder brother.

10:44.510 --> 10:45.840
Everyone, don't panic.

10:46.390 --> 10:48.030
Don't be afraid.

10:49.480 --> 10:50.750
When Mr. Yang was a guest at our home,

10:50.750 --> 10:52.480
he unfortunately passed away.

10:52.510 --> 10:54.400
The Rong family
can't be absolved of the blame.

10:54.400 --> 10:56.000
My condolences, Uncle Yang.

10:56.240 --> 10:58.900
Let's discuss this further
inside the mansion.

11:07.770 --> 11:08.600
Dingchen

11:08.670 --> 11:11.000
was the most outstanding son
of our Yang family.

11:11.000 --> 11:13.130
His death cannot remain unexplained.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.910
Under Lord Prefect's orders,
Magistrate Lang

11:15.910 --> 11:17.750
will personally
come to the Rong Mansion to investigate

11:17.750 --> 11:19.480
and examine the body publicly.

11:19.670 --> 11:21.840
Miss Rong, please allow it.

12:29.990 --> 12:31.790
It seems to be a human footprint,

12:32.350 --> 12:33.880
but only half of it remains.

12:34.080 --> 12:35.610
Lady Shanbao, you're back.

12:35.680 --> 12:37.240
I've been guarding this place with others,

12:37.240 --> 12:38.790
and no outsiders have entered.

12:38.790 --> 12:39.590
Open the door!

12:39.790 --> 12:40.240
Yes!

12:57.000 --> 12:58.510
Oh, my nephew!

12:58.630 --> 13:00.240
Oh, my nephew!

13:01.270 --> 13:02.790
-Oh, my nephew!
-Father!

13:04.790 --> 13:05.320
Father!

13:06.270 --> 13:06.750
Father!

13:14.240 --> 13:15.440
-My nephew!
-Father!

13:19.000 --> 13:20.150
My nephew!

13:22.270 --> 13:24.910
Who was so vicious and did this?

13:30.050 --> 13:31.530
I'm late.

13:34.180 --> 13:35.330
Oh, my nephew!

13:41.960 --> 13:44.030
How could the murderer be so cruel?

13:48.630 --> 13:49.960
I will certainly

13:49.960 --> 13:51.320
seek justice for you.

13:53.560 --> 13:55.410
Just rest assured, my nephew.

14:03.960 --> 14:05.150
I will definitely

14:05.150 --> 14:07.000
seek justice for you.

14:16.510 --> 14:17.440
How would you...

14:18.750 --> 14:20.460
How would you expect me
to explain this to your...

14:20.460 --> 14:23.190
After this incident,
I ordered servants to guard this place,

14:23.190 --> 14:25.390
not allowing anyone to move the corpse,

14:25.460 --> 14:27.520
so as to let the officials examine it.

14:27.790 --> 14:28.910
As soon as the person I had sent
to notify the officials

14:28.910 --> 14:29.770
just returned,

14:30.390 --> 14:31.870
your sedan chair arrived.

14:32.750 --> 14:34.350
My Lord, you came so quickly.

14:34.550 --> 14:36.120
I bear a heavy responsibility

14:36.120 --> 14:38.440
to protect the safety of the local people,

14:38.440 --> 14:41.300
so it's my duty
to investigate the case personally.

14:42.510 --> 14:43.320
My nephew!

14:43.320 --> 14:45.180
Father! Father, you're an elder.

14:45.390 --> 14:46.750
If you get so heart-broken for my cousin,

14:46.750 --> 14:48.130
he would be unable to rest in peace.

14:48.130 --> 14:49.990
Please take good care of yourself

14:50.480 --> 14:52.810
so that you can take revenge
for my cousin.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.300
He has passed away.

14:54.550 --> 14:56.280
Master Yang, excessive grief is not good.

14:56.280 --> 14:57.280
Now that I am here,

14:57.550 --> 14:59.000
I will certainly try to find the culprit

14:59.000 --> 15:00.660
and seek justice for Mr. Yang.

15:01.550 --> 15:02.680
Start examining it!

15:18.490 --> 15:19.090
Father.

15:20.510 --> 15:22.030
The coroner needs to examine the body.

15:22.030 --> 15:24.560
It's not convenient
for outsiders to stay here.

15:24.560 --> 15:26.760
Besides, Lady Rong Shanbao is delicate

15:27.150 --> 15:28.610
and can't see such a scene.

15:29.030 --> 15:30.440
You'd better go out first.

15:30.440 --> 15:32.040
I'll watch over things here.

15:32.970 --> 15:33.490
Jie You!

15:34.200 --> 15:34.680
Yes!

15:56.670 --> 15:58.600
Take our guests to the main hall for tea.

15:58.600 --> 15:59.270
-Yes.
-Yes.

16:01.550 --> 16:03.080
My Lord, please.

16:04.320 --> 16:04.870
My Lord.

16:07.400 --> 16:08.160
No rush.

16:08.630 --> 16:10.840
How has Old Madam Rong
been feeling lately?

16:10.840 --> 16:11.970
Since I took office,

16:12.030 --> 16:13.080
I've been so busy with my work

16:13.080 --> 16:14.550
and haven't had time to pay my respects.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.750
I feel quite ashamed.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.630
Now that I'm in the Rong Mansion today,

16:17.630 --> 16:18.830
I must pay her a visit.

16:24.080 --> 16:24.720
I'll...

16:25.240 --> 16:26.640
show you the way, My Lord.

16:26.670 --> 16:27.270
Thank you.

16:29.390 --> 16:30.960
As per the routines, the County Office
needs to interrogate the servants.

16:30.960 --> 16:32.200
which might cause some inconvenience.

16:32.200 --> 16:34.360
Please allow it, Lady Rong Shanbao.

16:51.630 --> 16:53.560
The inspection has been finished.

16:55.030 --> 16:55.600
My Lord.

16:57.320 --> 16:59.450
I'd like to have a word with my brother.

17:00.720 --> 17:02.050
Could you let me do that?

17:48.270 --> 17:48.920
Look.

17:51.480 --> 17:52.510
Even the Sinan jade craftsmen

17:52.510 --> 17:55.040
couldn't
tell these two pieces of jade apart.

17:58.720 --> 17:59.720
Back then, our mother said that

17:59.720 --> 18:01.200
I was born only 15 minutes

18:01.200 --> 18:02.400
later than you.

18:03.640 --> 18:05.440
But because of these 15 minutes,

18:06.640 --> 18:09.590
you became the official kiln porcelain
for protecting our house

18:09.590 --> 18:10.310
while I became

18:10.310 --> 18:13.030
the unpresentable counterfeit porcelain.

18:15.270 --> 18:16.030
Everyone said

18:16.030 --> 18:18.760
you were
the Yang family's most outstanding son.

18:20.440 --> 18:21.110
However,

18:23.680 --> 18:24.720
you're dead now.

18:32.350 --> 18:33.350
You're dead now!

18:34.920 --> 18:36.160
You're dead now!

18:37.000 --> 18:38.720
It's so good that you're dead.

18:39.830 --> 18:40.400
Just see

18:40.400 --> 18:41.830
how I'll use your appearance

18:41.830 --> 18:43.000
to inherit the family property

18:43.000 --> 18:44.310
and use my own flesh and blood

18:44.310 --> 18:46.570
to drink the wedding wine in place of you.

18:50.110 --> 18:52.110
I will prove to everyone in the world

18:53.680 --> 18:54.790
that I'm actually

18:54.790 --> 18:57.250
the most outstanding son
of the Yang family.

19:02.310 --> 19:03.960
My dear brother.

19:11.550 --> 19:12.270
Mr. Yang

19:12.270 --> 19:13.960
originally lived in the Xinfang Pavilion.

19:13.960 --> 19:15.110
I'll take you both there to have a look.

19:15.110 --> 19:16.480
Okay. Thank you.

19:17.270 --> 19:18.400
What a big mansion!

19:18.830 --> 19:20.160
It's truly the style of a great family.

19:20.160 --> 19:20.920
Even heavenly palaces

19:20.920 --> 19:22.400
could hardly be more magnificent.

19:22.400 --> 19:24.200
Mr. Yang was truly unfortunate.

19:27.110 --> 19:27.790
Mr. Yan.

19:30.590 --> 19:32.190
Officers, this way, please.

19:32.270 --> 19:32.710
Okay.

19:34.210 --> 19:35.140
Look over there.

19:37.880 --> 19:39.280
What's wrong with Mr. Lu?

19:39.440 --> 19:41.460
He's sneaking around and is so secretive.

19:41.460 --> 19:42.260
In my opinion,

19:42.400 --> 19:43.240
Mr. Yang

19:43.240 --> 19:44.200
must have been killed by him.

19:44.200 --> 19:44.750
Shut up!

19:45.720 --> 19:47.250
If the constables hear you,

19:47.400 --> 19:49.860
you'll be wrongly accusing
an innocent man.

20:44.680 --> 20:47.480
That magistrate
who came to Rong Mansion today...

20:47.680 --> 20:48.270
What?

20:49.750 --> 20:50.610
Do you know him?

20:51.510 --> 20:52.910
He looks quite familiar.

20:54.810 --> 20:55.480
But I...

20:57.700 --> 21:00.230
But I just can't remember
where I've seen him.

21:00.830 --> 21:01.750
Lord Lang

21:02.110 --> 21:03.840
was promoted by Prefect Xu Song

21:04.070 --> 21:05.880
to become the Magistrate of Chunning.

21:05.880 --> 21:07.720
He sent his calling card here
several times

21:07.720 --> 21:10.110
but was always turned away
by the Rong family.

21:10.110 --> 21:10.920
Today, he could finally

21:10.920 --> 21:12.450
use the investigation as an excuse

21:12.450 --> 21:14.510
to insist on meeting my grandmother.

21:14.680 --> 21:16.270
In the Chongxi Hall, he fawned on us

21:16.270 --> 21:18.000
and tried every way
to ask for money and valuables.

21:18.000 --> 21:19.930
His behavior is truly despicable.

21:23.510 --> 21:24.640
Just now in the room,

21:25.030 --> 21:26.290
did you find anything?

21:30.000 --> 21:30.860
What are you...

21:34.010 --> 21:36.610
The bloodstain
was in an inconspicuous place.

21:38.160 --> 21:39.550
And only half of it remained.

21:39.550 --> 21:41.350
Outsiders could hardly identify it.

21:41.350 --> 21:43.200
But judging from the footprint,

21:43.840 --> 21:45.500
this person wore shoes
with pointed toecaps

21:45.500 --> 21:46.750
as well as flat and thin soles.

21:46.750 --> 21:48.510
There were even patterns
carved into the wooden base.

21:48.510 --> 21:50.310
It was such an intricate design.

21:50.350 --> 21:51.880
This must belong to a woman.

21:53.000 --> 21:54.350
Yang Dingchen
was highly skilled in martial arts

21:54.350 --> 21:56.030
with incredible arm strength.

21:56.030 --> 21:57.000
What kind of woman

21:57.000 --> 21:59.110
could sneak into the mansion and kill him?

21:59.110 --> 21:59.680
Besides,

22:00.350 --> 22:02.310
many people
have carved patterns on their shoe soles.

22:02.310 --> 22:04.320
Are we supposed to catch everyone
for comparison?

22:04.320 --> 22:06.320
But this isn't an ordinary pattern.

22:08.240 --> 22:10.200
My Lady! Lord Lang

22:10.200 --> 22:12.000
summoned all young ladies
and young masters to see him.

22:12.000 --> 22:14.400
He said
he would interrogate them in court.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.000
I'll look into it.

22:20.680 --> 22:22.790
Grandmother gave him seven days
to investigate the case.

22:22.790 --> 22:24.850
In the mansion, there will be constables
coming and going inevitably.

22:24.850 --> 22:26.510
Your identity is still unclear,

22:26.510 --> 22:28.400
and we also don't know
who your enemies are.

22:28.400 --> 22:30.270
If you need anything,
just ask Jun Dai to do it.

22:30.270 --> 22:31.940
Don't show yourself unnecessarily,

22:31.940 --> 22:33.470
to avoid bringing trouble.

22:48.310 --> 22:49.500
It's all my fault for being careless.

22:49.500 --> 22:51.760
I didn't even notice such a small detail.

22:52.960 --> 22:53.720
Did he really

22:54.400 --> 22:56.580
not have that bodhi-bead bracelet on him?

22:56.580 --> 22:58.110
Speaking of which,
this matter is so strange.

22:58.110 --> 22:59.270
As soon as I got the message this morning,

22:59.270 --> 23:00.160
I went there to search him.

23:00.160 --> 23:01.560
But I truly didn't see it.

23:01.680 --> 23:03.350
My Lady, do you think it might be...

23:03.350 --> 23:03.960
Silence!

23:07.270 --> 23:08.880
Yang Dingchen has done many evil things.

23:08.880 --> 23:10.070
He deserved such an ending

23:10.070 --> 23:11.440
due to his own deeds.

23:12.350 --> 23:15.610
Mr. Yan, why do you have to
trouble yourself because of him?

23:15.640 --> 23:17.200
Mr. Wen, please forgive me
for being outspoken.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.310
People from the County Office came today.

23:18.310 --> 23:19.160
They interrogated everyone

23:19.160 --> 23:20.350
from the Xinfang Pavilion.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.510
Only one person stayed in his room

23:21.510 --> 23:22.640
without showing up.

23:22.680 --> 23:24.310
He clearly has a guilty conscience.

23:24.310 --> 23:25.110
In my opinion,

23:25.160 --> 23:25.750
Mr. Yang

23:25.750 --> 23:27.350
must have been killed by him.

23:27.830 --> 23:29.160
If you continue to talk nonsense,

23:29.160 --> 23:30.250
just get out of my sight,

23:30.250 --> 23:31.980
and I won't keep you any longer.

23:32.240 --> 23:33.950
I'm not a hereditary servant‌,

23:33.950 --> 23:35.810
so I don't understand the etiquette
of a great family.

23:35.810 --> 23:36.960
Young Master, you rescued me

23:36.960 --> 23:38.000
from the pile of dead bodies.

23:38.000 --> 23:39.810
Your kindness to me
is higher than the sky.

23:39.810 --> 23:41.400
If Steward Lu really killed him,

23:41.400 --> 23:42.890
he would harm you sooner or later.

23:42.890 --> 23:44.350
How could I remain silent?

23:45.830 --> 23:46.630
So you mean...

23:48.240 --> 23:49.480
Lu Fusheng is the murderer?

23:49.480 --> 23:50.880
Mr. Lu has helped you greatly

23:50.880 --> 23:52.240
and is the loyalest and kindest person.

23:52.240 --> 23:54.640
Don't listen to
this ignorant boy's nonsense.

23:54.640 --> 23:56.030
He's still young and unsophisticated,

23:56.030 --> 23:57.680
knowing nothing about importance.

23:57.680 --> 23:58.940
Without any evidence,

23:59.070 --> 24:02.270
we absolutely cannot
wrongly accuse an innocent person.

24:02.400 --> 24:04.160
Mr. Wen! Mr. Wen!

24:06.700 --> 24:08.900
Look at you. You keep talking nonsense.

24:09.050 --> 24:11.310
You'll cause me trouble sooner or later.

24:11.720 --> 24:13.270
One can't be kind
in a den of tigers and wolves.

24:13.270 --> 24:15.280
Young Master,
just be careful and vigilant.

24:15.280 --> 24:17.270
[Chongxi Hall]

24:25.880 --> 24:27.070
One Yang died,

24:27.640 --> 24:29.370
and another Yang has appeared.

24:29.440 --> 24:31.570
This situation is truly frightening.

24:32.310 --> 24:34.130
Yang Dingchen was unruly and rebellious,

24:34.130 --> 24:35.780
like a wild beast
that had just been released from its cage

24:35.780 --> 24:37.240
and was difficult to tame.

24:37.790 --> 24:40.310
Though this young master looks similar,

24:41.080 --> 24:43.230
his behavior is quite refined.

24:51.960 --> 24:54.400
Routinely,
I need to ask you all young ladies

24:54.400 --> 24:56.400
where you were at the time of the incident

24:56.400 --> 24:57.930
and who can testify for you.

24:58.160 --> 24:58.820
What a fool!

24:59.200 --> 24:59.640
You...

25:00.420 --> 25:01.350
Stop saying you.

25:02.680 --> 25:04.590
You were summoned to the Rong family
to arrest the murderer.

25:04.590 --> 25:05.320
But instead,

25:05.350 --> 25:06.920
you mistook innocent people for suspects.

25:06.920 --> 25:08.440
Where else could I be roaming
in the middle of the night

25:08.440 --> 25:09.790
if I wasn't in my room?

25:09.790 --> 25:11.070
Besides my personal maid,

25:11.070 --> 25:13.330
where else could I find other witnesses?

25:14.160 --> 25:14.960
Moreover,

25:15.210 --> 25:17.340
I had no grudges against Yang Dingchen

25:17.370 --> 25:19.030
and scarcely talked with him.

25:19.270 --> 25:21.670
What benefit would I gain
from killing him?

25:21.880 --> 25:23.790
Letting a foolish official like you
try the case

25:23.790 --> 25:26.050
will only lead to wrongful convictions.

25:26.440 --> 25:27.110
Lord Lang.

25:28.110 --> 25:29.270
My cousin is straightforward

25:29.270 --> 25:30.130
and outspoken.

25:30.590 --> 25:32.030
She has offended you today.

25:32.030 --> 25:33.160
Please forgive her

25:33.510 --> 25:34.510
and don't mind it.

25:35.070 --> 25:37.350
It's my fault
for trying the case improperly.

25:37.350 --> 25:38.680
I've told you

25:38.960 --> 25:40.960
we need to do the fortune-telling
for the wedding ceremony first

25:40.960 --> 25:43.020
and get approval from our ancestors.

25:43.310 --> 25:44.440
Mr. Yang

25:44.550 --> 25:46.320
occupied our Qilan Garden
without permission.

25:46.320 --> 25:47.790
Lady Shanbao ordered our maids

25:47.790 --> 25:49.000
to withdraw completely.

25:49.000 --> 25:50.480
We even gave him that courtyard.

25:50.480 --> 25:52.540
That was already more than generous.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.680
Even if something had gone wrong,

25:55.420 --> 25:58.620
the Yang family's members
should be interrogated first.

26:01.250 --> 26:02.850
They've been interrogated.

26:03.790 --> 26:04.590
Young Master.

26:04.640 --> 26:06.840
Lady Rong Shanbao hasn't returned yet.

26:07.200 --> 26:07.790
Get lost!

26:08.640 --> 26:09.770
All of you, get lost!

26:12.270 --> 26:13.830
Last night, Yang Dingchen noticed that
Lady Rong Shanbao

26:13.830 --> 26:15.540
still didn't return late at night.

26:15.540 --> 26:16.540
He became furious

26:16.780 --> 26:19.380
and drove away
all the Yang family's servants.

26:24.420 --> 26:25.220
Lady Shanbao.

26:25.620 --> 26:28.030
Lord Lang
isn't deliberately giving you a hard time.

26:28.030 --> 26:30.070
Routinely,
everyone has to be interrogated.

26:30.070 --> 26:31.530
Old Madam has agreed, too.

26:33.830 --> 26:35.960
Since you all have a clear conscience,

26:36.110 --> 26:37.840
What couldn't you tell others?

26:57.070 --> 26:57.750
Xiangling.

26:58.550 --> 26:59.640
Lord Lang hasn't interrogated you

26:59.640 --> 27:00.550
in court.

27:00.790 --> 27:02.640
That's already special treatment.

27:02.640 --> 27:04.100
We'd better tell the truth

27:04.680 --> 27:05.400
so that people won't say

27:05.400 --> 27:07.000
we have a guilty conscience.

27:07.750 --> 27:08.440
Lord Lang.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.310
A few close friends of mine and I

27:10.310 --> 27:11.240
held a tea party.

27:11.680 --> 27:13.960
Yesterday,
it was my turn to host the party,

27:13.960 --> 27:15.270
so I set up a tea banquet

27:15.350 --> 27:16.680
in the Shanju Tea House.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.640
We chatted under the moonlight,

27:18.640 --> 27:19.970
enjoying tea and music.

27:20.350 --> 27:21.830
We only returned at dawn.

27:22.070 --> 27:22.880
Yunxi.

27:23.160 --> 27:25.090
You're the owner of this tea house,

27:25.270 --> 27:27.440
so you can say whatever you want,
can't you?

27:27.440 --> 27:29.300
My tea house stays open all night,

27:29.440 --> 27:30.480
specializing in
receiving aristocratic ladies‌

27:30.480 --> 27:31.750
who enjoy night outings.

27:31.750 --> 27:32.680
Many people in the city

27:32.680 --> 27:33.920
can testify for me.

27:34.510 --> 27:35.720
Yesterday, a servant from the greenhouse

27:35.720 --> 27:36.790
suddenly came to report some good news,

27:36.790 --> 27:38.880
saying that my rare epiphyllum
was about to bloom,

27:38.880 --> 27:41.350
so I just invited Yunyin
to come and appreciate it.

27:41.350 --> 27:42.900
We didn't leave until midnight.

27:42.900 --> 27:44.750
Then we returned to our own rooms to rest.

27:44.750 --> 27:45.480
Yunshu and I

27:45.480 --> 27:47.070
went to the Yanyun Temple
to worship Buddha.

27:47.070 --> 27:48.400
We listened to scriptures all day long

27:48.400 --> 27:50.200
and closed our doors to rest early
after returning.

27:50.200 --> 27:52.200
I suppose Yunshu did the same thing.

27:55.380 --> 27:57.910
Alright.
Let's stop beating around the bush.

27:58.520 --> 28:00.310
Am I the one who should be interrogated
most necessarily here?

28:00.310 --> 28:01.270
Or it is Yunxi

28:01.590 --> 28:02.480
or Yunshu?

28:03.110 --> 28:04.550
All of you are trying to hide the truth

28:04.550 --> 28:06.030
by making all kinds of excuses.

28:06.030 --> 28:07.790
For whom are you putting on this show?

28:07.790 --> 28:08.350
Fine.

28:09.270 --> 28:10.680
Since none of you dare to ask,

28:10.680 --> 28:11.640
then I'll ask.

28:13.030 --> 28:14.160
Whose fiancé

28:14.160 --> 28:15.830
is Yang Dingchen?

28:15.960 --> 28:17.550
And in whose room did he die?

28:50.160 --> 28:51.640
This is Lady Shanbao's order.

28:51.640 --> 28:53.440
Doctor Zhao has just changed it.

28:59.480 --> 29:00.280
Young Master!

29:02.830 --> 29:03.440
Mr. Lu!

29:03.880 --> 29:05.310
B-Bad news!

29:05.550 --> 29:06.960
Over there in the hall, Lord Lang

29:06.960 --> 29:09.760
is...is interrogating Lady Shanbao
coercively.

29:11.610 --> 29:12.980
Your identity is still unclear,

29:12.980 --> 29:14.580
and we also don't know
who your enemies are.

29:14.580 --> 29:15.980
Don't show yourself unnecessarily,

29:15.980 --> 29:17.510
to avoid bringing trouble.

29:21.350 --> 29:23.680
Did your young master tell you
to say this?

29:24.030 --> 29:24.680
Mr. Lu.

29:25.590 --> 29:27.270
The Yang family won't let this go.

29:27.270 --> 29:28.890
And the officials keep interrogating her.

29:28.890 --> 29:30.090
How can Lady Shanbao

29:30.400 --> 29:31.640
accept this humiliation?

29:31.640 --> 29:32.770
You need to find a way

29:32.820 --> 29:34.680
to help her get rid of this plight.

29:34.790 --> 29:36.880
I got it. You may go.

29:37.070 --> 29:37.440
I...

29:37.470 --> 29:38.430
Enough!

29:38.490 --> 29:39.350
The young master already said he got it.

29:39.350 --> 29:40.000
Why are you still pestering him?

29:40.000 --> 29:40.350
You...

29:40.350 --> 29:41.160
-Just go now!
-You need to find a way!

29:41.160 --> 29:42.090
-Mr. Lu!
-Hurry!

29:44.000 --> 29:46.350
Young Master,
Lady Shanbao repeatedly told you

29:46.350 --> 29:48.300
not to show yourself unnecessarily.

29:48.300 --> 29:49.720
This person is trying so hard
to stir up trouble outside.

29:49.720 --> 29:51.320
He must have ill intentions.

29:54.600 --> 29:55.230
I know.

29:56.950 --> 29:58.550
Lady Shanbao has her own judgment.

29:58.550 --> 30:00.680
Young Master,
please just eat your meal and don't worry.

30:00.680 --> 30:02.080
The food is getting cold.

30:11.830 --> 30:14.350
Young Master, won't you have your meal?

30:15.310 --> 30:16.110
Young Master!

30:24.200 --> 30:25.110
Shanbao.

30:25.830 --> 30:27.890
I have trust in your moral character.

30:28.200 --> 30:29.920
Let me just ask you one question.

30:29.920 --> 30:32.580
Last night
should have been your wedding night.

30:32.790 --> 30:33.920
Why did my nephew

30:34.000 --> 30:35.800
die alone in the bridal chamber?

30:36.070 --> 30:37.440
And where were you?

30:38.240 --> 30:39.240
You should give me

30:39.400 --> 30:41.400
and the Yang family an explanation.

30:41.550 --> 30:42.480
What wedding?

30:43.000 --> 30:44.440
Before getting married,
the couple must enter the ancestral hall

30:44.440 --> 30:46.110
and pay respects to the ancestors
to complete the ceremony.

30:46.110 --> 30:47.790
Without the elders' permission
or Lady Shanbao's consent,

30:47.790 --> 30:49.480
he forcibly occupied the house
to hold a wedding.

30:49.480 --> 30:51.030
How was he any different from a bandit?

30:51.030 --> 30:52.880
You only know how to make things difficult
for Lady Shanbao.

30:52.880 --> 30:54.270
There's someone even more suspicious,

30:54.270 --> 30:56.200
who hasn't been interrogated yet.

30:58.270 --> 30:59.000
Mr. Bai.

30:59.750 --> 31:01.720
At 5 AM, Mr. Yan and I

31:01.720 --> 31:04.150
saw you returning from outside
with our own eyes.

31:04.150 --> 31:04.880
You claimed that

31:04.880 --> 31:06.640
you had taken a walk
outside the Xinfang Pavilion.

31:06.640 --> 31:09.110
But I noticed
that there was mud on your boots,

31:09.110 --> 31:11.790
and there were several peach blossoms
in your hair.

31:11.790 --> 31:14.310
You seemed to have returned
from the garden.

31:19.480 --> 31:21.110
Mr. Wen, so you suspect that

31:21.550 --> 31:22.750
I killed Mr. Yang?

31:27.360 --> 31:28.680
In the martial arts arena,

31:28.680 --> 31:30.720
everyone saw that my strength was so weak.

31:30.720 --> 31:32.640
I was just lucky to survive.

31:33.240 --> 31:34.370
How could I kill him?

31:34.880 --> 31:35.480
Moreover,

31:35.830 --> 31:36.920
even after he died,

31:37.480 --> 31:39.420
it wouldn't be my turn
to live in the Qilan Garden anyway.

31:39.420 --> 31:40.880
Isn't Mr. Wen still there,

31:41.200 --> 31:42.680
waiting for it eagerly?

31:43.110 --> 31:44.840
Which fool would do such things

31:44.880 --> 31:46.480
as working for someone else's benefit?

31:46.480 --> 31:47.620
I didn't stay out all night.

31:47.620 --> 31:49.030
Nor did I lie against my conscience.

31:49.030 --> 31:49.960
As a scholar,

31:50.110 --> 31:51.070
you tried to hide the truth
against your conscience like this

31:51.070 --> 31:52.200
and said things inconsistent
with your thoughts.

31:52.200 --> 31:54.400
Is this what the teachers have taught you?

31:54.400 --> 31:55.160
Where on earth did you go

31:55.160 --> 31:56.070
last night?

31:56.480 --> 31:58.000
This is a murder case.

31:58.420 --> 31:59.680
What can't you tell us?

32:05.680 --> 32:07.070
Last night, he and I

32:07.730 --> 32:09.560
were at the rockery
in the east corner of the garden,

32:09.560 --> 32:11.160
gazing at stars and talking.

32:23.860 --> 32:24.590
How dare you!

32:38.440 --> 32:39.990
She admitted her own disgrace.

32:39.990 --> 32:41.850
Yet you're still taking her side?

32:43.030 --> 32:44.640
Yunshu, you're so pathetic.

32:45.480 --> 32:47.160
As a daughter of the Rong family,

32:47.160 --> 32:49.220
so what even if you had done it openly?

32:49.720 --> 32:51.380
What kind of disgrace is this?

32:51.880 --> 32:54.270
According to the age-old instructions
of the Rong family,

32:54.270 --> 32:55.960
whoever dares to
hurt the Rong family's daughters

32:55.960 --> 32:57.480
is trying to
cut off our family's bloodline.

32:57.480 --> 32:58.540
No matter who he is,

32:58.720 --> 32:59.790
we'll ensure
that his family property is all ruined

32:59.790 --> 33:00.850
with no penny left.

33:01.160 --> 33:03.290
Mr. He, you'd better think carefully.

33:04.440 --> 33:06.500
At the tea party Yunxi hosted last night,

33:06.500 --> 33:08.630
weren't you also a guest there, Mr. He?

33:09.310 --> 33:11.280
Firstly,
you insulted my mother repeatedly.

33:11.280 --> 33:13.210
And then you tried to fawn on Yunxi.

33:13.270 --> 33:15.030
So only you're allowed to break promises,

33:15.030 --> 33:16.750
but I can't find another better fiancé?

33:16.750 --> 33:18.030
There's no such unfairness in the world.

33:18.030 --> 33:18.750
Yunxi.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.890
This is breaking a serious taboo.

33:21.070 --> 33:22.790
Mr. He, you're so indecisive

33:22.790 --> 33:23.920
and fickle-minded.

33:24.480 --> 33:25.640
You've sown discord

33:25.640 --> 33:26.400
between my two sisters

33:26.400 --> 33:27.830
and broken the rules of the Rong family.

33:27.830 --> 33:29.590
If Grandmother finds out about that,

33:29.590 --> 33:31.880
the He family
definitely won't gain any benefit.

33:31.880 --> 33:33.440
I advise you to back down

33:33.440 --> 33:34.920
and avoid causing more trouble.

33:34.920 --> 33:36.430
You forced me into this.

33:39.590 --> 33:41.110
The family affairs among our sisters

33:41.110 --> 33:42.550
can be discussed later.

33:43.390 --> 33:45.510
Let's ask about
the important matters first.

33:45.510 --> 33:47.270
Lady Shanbao,
we asked about your whereabouts just now,

33:47.270 --> 33:49.130
but you were reluctant to answer.

33:49.400 --> 33:52.160
Do you have something to hide?

33:52.680 --> 33:53.940
I have nothing to hide.

33:54.440 --> 33:55.770
I didn't fancy Mr. Yang,

33:56.240 --> 33:58.400
and I was unwilling to
spend the weddning night with him,

33:58.400 --> 34:00.960
so I simply stayed elsewhere last night.

34:02.110 --> 34:03.000
Elsewhere?

34:03.680 --> 34:04.720
Where exactly?

34:05.350 --> 34:06.480
Whose place was it?

34:07.110 --> 34:09.570
Even if I'm not asking,
they'll ask in court.

34:09.760 --> 34:10.550
Shanbao.

34:11.280 --> 34:12.880
If you didn't fancy Mr. Yang,

34:13.440 --> 34:14.639
then who do you fancy?

34:15.280 --> 34:17.080
Who did you spend the night with?

34:30.960 --> 34:31.760
Young Master!

34:31.960 --> 34:33.489
Young Master, you can't go!

34:33.760 --> 34:34.560
Young Master!

34:36.550 --> 34:37.360
Don't go!

34:37.960 --> 34:38.820
You mustn't go!

34:39.100 --> 34:40.500
You absolutely can't go!

34:50.350 --> 34:52.880
I fell from a cliff
and was in a critical condition

34:52.880 --> 34:54.150
while he became an official

34:54.150 --> 34:55.350
and enjoyed success.

34:55.750 --> 34:58.280
I can't believe
there was such a coincidence.

34:58.550 --> 34:59.810
I'm afraid that was...

35:01.030 --> 35:02.590
The Rong family only cares about
whether the daughters

35:02.590 --> 35:03.850
respect their elders,

35:04.050 --> 35:05.780
whether the sisters are united

35:05.910 --> 35:08.040
and whether the family is prosperous.

35:08.280 --> 35:10.280
It's up to you to choose who you love.

35:10.590 --> 35:11.840
Unless you commit crimes

35:11.840 --> 35:13.480
or disgrace the family's reputation,

35:13.480 --> 35:14.190
otherwise,

35:14.800 --> 35:16.400
the elders won't interfere.

35:17.520 --> 35:19.020
Grandmother always commends you

35:19.020 --> 35:21.540
for being sensible
and caring about the overall situation.

35:21.540 --> 35:23.480
Now someone from the Yang family
has been killed.

35:23.480 --> 35:25.550
All of us have revealed our whereabouts,

35:25.550 --> 35:27.550
except you who keep hiding something.

35:27.550 --> 35:28.280
Unless

35:28.670 --> 35:30.470
your lover is a bandit or a thief,

35:30.880 --> 35:32.840
and Mr. Yang was killed by him.

35:38.740 --> 35:39.510
Tell us!

35:42.710 --> 35:44.710
Don't give Lady Shanbao a hard time.

35:47.070 --> 35:47.930
That person...

35:48.270 --> 35:49.190
-That person is...
-Mr. Yan!

35:49.190 --> 35:50.110
Was it you yesterday?

35:50.110 --> 35:51.310
How dare you admit it?

35:52.230 --> 35:52.840
I admit it.

36:17.710 --> 36:18.800
Lady Shanbao, you and I were clearly

36:18.800 --> 36:20.990
chatting, playing chess and painting
under the moonlight.

36:20.990 --> 36:22.760
How come you refuse to admit it now?

36:22.760 --> 36:25.020
What makes you think I'm unpresentable?

36:28.400 --> 36:28.800
You...

36:32.390 --> 36:32.910
You...

36:35.860 --> 36:37.190
Magistrate Lang, what?

36:38.000 --> 36:39.130
Do you know this man?

37:00.050 --> 37:00.800
So you're

37:00.800 --> 37:02.060
Lady Shanbao's lover?

37:02.200 --> 37:03.840
No wonder!

37:07.470 --> 37:10.550
Yesterday, I accompanied Lady Shanbao
to the tea mountain.

37:10.550 --> 37:12.000
We only came down the mountain at 5 PM.

37:12.000 --> 37:13.590
At 7 PM, we went boating
to enjoy the scenery.

37:13.590 --> 37:14.460
When we returned home,

37:14.460 --> 37:16.750
we heard the night watch drum
at the city gate strike twice.

37:16.750 --> 37:18.070
Lady Shanbao complained
that my drawing had little likeness

37:18.070 --> 37:18.800
on the boat,

37:19.320 --> 37:21.380
so she asked me to redraw it in my room.

37:21.880 --> 37:23.070
By dawn,

37:23.480 --> 37:24.950
a maid came and reported the bad news.

37:24.950 --> 37:27.150
Only then did Lady Shanbao
leave the Xinfang Pavilion.

37:27.150 --> 37:29.710
Actually, regarding murderous intentions,

37:30.400 --> 37:31.200
everyone here

37:33.980 --> 37:35.500
is a suspect.

37:37.770 --> 37:39.570
Why do you think we're suspects?

37:39.670 --> 37:41.260
Lady Shanbao wanted to select a husband.

37:41.260 --> 37:42.970
Without being selected, this person
didn't blame his own incompetence.

37:42.970 --> 37:44.710
Instead, he was only jealous of others.

37:44.710 --> 37:46.720
By framing me after killing Mr. Yang,

37:46.720 --> 37:48.520
he could eliminate two enemies.

37:49.400 --> 37:51.530
Moreover, the Rong family is wealthy.

37:51.640 --> 37:53.980
Their tea mountains and silver
are so tempting.

37:53.980 --> 37:56.000
If Lady Shanbao is charged with murder,

37:56.000 --> 37:56.960
the substantial family property

37:56.960 --> 37:58.560
will be inherited by others.

37:58.710 --> 38:00.010
Guys, don't forget that

38:00.010 --> 38:01.580
Mr. Yang was killed at midnight

38:01.580 --> 38:03.380
and was only discovered at dawn.

38:03.760 --> 38:06.420
Those who had left home
could return to kill him.

38:06.800 --> 38:09.320
Those who met with each other
could collude in their statements.

38:09.320 --> 38:10.150
Those who testify for their whereabouts

38:10.150 --> 38:11.360
are all servants of the Rong family.

38:11.360 --> 38:12.820
How can their testimonies

38:14.670 --> 38:16.360
be easily trusted?

38:17.760 --> 38:18.480
You're accusing

38:18.480 --> 38:19.580
all of us at a stroke.

38:19.580 --> 38:20.360
I've never said

38:20.360 --> 38:22.220
you're the murderer, Lady Yunxi.

38:22.440 --> 38:23.570
Why are you so angry?

38:23.820 --> 38:24.220
You...

38:24.530 --> 38:26.530
What we said is all not trustworthy.

38:26.840 --> 38:28.500
Then the murderer of this case

38:28.510 --> 38:29.570
can never be found.

38:34.550 --> 38:35.190
Lord Lang!

38:35.800 --> 38:36.630
The bloody footprint in the room

38:36.630 --> 38:37.560
has been copied.

38:37.890 --> 38:40.950
The County Office's painter
has complemented it, too.

38:45.190 --> 38:46.960
This shoe sole is carved
with the five-poison patterns.

38:46.960 --> 38:48.280
The craftsmanship is exceptional.

38:48.280 --> 38:50.400
To solve this case,
please forgive my offense for asking

38:50.400 --> 38:53.460
which lady of the Rong family
owns this cherished item.

38:59.480 --> 39:00.550
No wonder you've gathered us all here

39:00.550 --> 39:01.750
with all this gossip.

39:01.760 --> 39:02.820
So it's about this?

39:06.550 --> 39:07.750
I don't recognize it.

39:08.830 --> 39:10.040
Everyone is watching.

39:10.040 --> 39:12.970
Do you expect us
to take off our shoes for inspection?

39:20.000 --> 39:21.330
The foot is 7.1 cun long.

39:21.520 --> 39:23.000
It's not difficult to verify it.

39:23.000 --> 39:23.800
Measurement is conducted every year

39:23.800 --> 39:25.360
in our mansion to make shoes.

39:25.360 --> 39:27.360
We can check the records to find out.

39:30.630 --> 39:31.430
Lady Shanbao.

39:32.060 --> 39:33.520
Thanks for your help then.

39:35.070 --> 39:35.670
Xiu Qiong.

39:36.320 --> 39:37.720
For the sake of fairness,

39:38.000 --> 39:39.070
Lord Lang, please

39:39.070 --> 39:40.900
dispatch two constables to accompany us

39:40.900 --> 39:43.030
so that we won't be suspected anymore.

39:43.260 --> 39:45.060
Lady Yunxi's worry makes sense.

39:45.350 --> 39:47.480
Not only the young ladies
need to be examined,

39:47.480 --> 39:49.710
but all female servants of the Rong family

39:49.710 --> 39:50.970
must also be examined.

40:03.110 --> 40:03.840
Mr. Lu.

40:04.440 --> 40:05.510
I still have a few more questions

40:05.510 --> 40:06.510
to ask you alone.

40:07.590 --> 40:08.230
Please.

40:09.110 --> 40:09.670
What?

40:11.030 --> 40:12.030
-Go!
-Let go of me!

40:12.320 --> 40:13.850
-Cut the crap!
-Let go of me!

40:15.070 --> 40:16.880
You knew he was avoiding the officials
and constables everywhere.

40:16.880 --> 40:18.270
He must have his reasons.

40:18.270 --> 40:19.800
Why did you deliberately lure him
to come here?

40:19.800 --> 40:21.070
Mr. Yan, you're such a gentleman

40:21.070 --> 40:22.590
and are so honest and upright.

40:22.590 --> 40:23.400
In your mind,

40:23.950 --> 40:26.380
there are scarcely any villains
in this world.

40:26.380 --> 40:27.590
But this man's background is suspicious.

40:27.590 --> 40:28.920
His intentions are dubious.

40:28.920 --> 40:32.030
With his evasiveness,
he's surely hiding some dirty secrets.

40:32.030 --> 40:32.840
I've done this

40:33.440 --> 40:36.550
because I'm worried
Shanbao might be harmed by a villain.

40:36.550 --> 40:39.110
You've done this
for your own selfish motives.

40:39.110 --> 40:39.760
Mr. Wen.

40:40.300 --> 40:41.960
You weren't like this before.

40:41.960 --> 40:42.440
When...

40:42.770 --> 40:44.960
-Since when...
-All men have jealousy.

40:44.960 --> 40:46.420
I'm not afraid to admit it.

40:48.000 --> 40:48.710
I'm just worried

40:48.710 --> 40:50.240
this man has ill intentions

40:50.830 --> 40:52.090
and will harm Shanbao.

40:55.000 --> 40:55.840
What are you doing?

40:55.840 --> 40:56.500
Let go of me!

41:12.040 --> 41:13.440
You guys may leave first.

41:26.900 --> 41:28.340
So you want to kill me?

41:35.390 --> 41:36.020
My Lord.

41:37.190 --> 41:38.320
I finally found you.

41:38.950 --> 41:39.680
Don't worry.

41:40.150 --> 41:40.920
Those who entered the mansion today

41:40.920 --> 41:42.180
are all my trusted men.

41:42.200 --> 41:43.600
There will be no problem.

41:45.320 --> 41:47.440
My Lord, you used yourself as the bait.

41:47.440 --> 41:48.750
Indeed, you made Lady Rong Shanbao

41:48.750 --> 41:49.880
take pity on you

41:50.230 --> 41:51.090
and rescue you.

41:51.510 --> 41:53.030
Later, as agreed, I sent some people

41:53.030 --> 41:54.670
to wait in that Wukui Alley for 7 days,

41:54.670 --> 41:56.200
but there was no sign of you.

41:56.400 --> 41:58.030
I reckoned your injuries were too severe
to recover soon,

41:58.030 --> 41:59.390
or the Rong family
was keeping a close eye on you,

41:59.390 --> 42:00.840
making it difficult to send messages,

42:00.840 --> 42:03.360
so I often sent people to scout
outside the mansion.

42:03.360 --> 42:05.190
However, every time you left the mansion,

42:05.190 --> 42:07.150
the Rong family's members
were always by your side.

42:07.150 --> 42:09.010
My men was afraid of alerting them

42:09.200 --> 42:11.000
and didn't dare to approach you.

42:11.960 --> 42:13.590
Using myself as the bait?

42:18.770 --> 42:19.850
So you mean...

42:20.310 --> 42:20.870
My Lord.

42:21.230 --> 42:22.550
You took the imperial order
to investigate the murder case

42:22.550 --> 42:24.440
of Wei Kejian
beating and killing his wife, Madam Yang.

42:24.440 --> 42:25.760
But the Rong family is powerful,

42:25.760 --> 42:27.350
and Lady Rong Shanbao
is quite resourceful.

42:27.350 --> 42:29.070
Xu Song repeatedly hindered you, too.

42:29.070 --> 42:30.540
It was very difficult to handle this case.

42:30.540 --> 42:32.150
You said, that page boy, Qing Yun,

42:32.150 --> 42:33.710
often eavesdropped on our conversations.

42:33.710 --> 42:35.190
He must have ill intentions behind this.

42:35.190 --> 42:36.590
Therefore, you took the risk yourself

42:36.590 --> 42:39.150
by secretly infiltrating into
the Rong family.

42:39.150 --> 42:40.910
You also told me to take the opportunity
to defect to Xu Song.

42:40.910 --> 42:42.770
Then we could collect evidence
both openly and secretly.

42:42.770 --> 42:44.570
Have you forgotten everything?

42:51.770 --> 42:52.330
My Lord!

42:59.230 --> 43:00.360
If you die,

43:00.550 --> 43:01.710
the great credit
for solving this major case

43:01.710 --> 43:02.920
will belong to me.

43:03.440 --> 43:04.550
Who told you

43:04.850 --> 43:06.650
our lord was taking risks alone?

43:08.510 --> 43:10.230
Under His Majesty's imperial edict,

43:10.230 --> 43:12.250
I work as the magistrate superficially,
but actually, I'm the Imperial Inspector.

43:12.250 --> 43:14.400
I'm telling you to open the coffin
and examine the corpse.

43:14.400 --> 43:16.740
Anyone who dares to hinder it
is defying imperial orders.

43:16.740 --> 43:18.320
My Lord,
you're not afraid of the powerful gentry

43:18.320 --> 43:19.420
and refuse to shield your former allies.

43:19.420 --> 43:21.480
You always recklessly
show your ability and talent.

43:21.480 --> 43:23.680
But you might just get killed in the end.

43:47.200 --> 43:48.130
Let's go! Hurry!

46:47.810 --> 46:50.010
[Making Friends through Tea
and Treating People with Courtesy]

46:51.280 --> 46:53.650
Routinely,
I need to ask you all young ladies

46:53.650 --> 46:55.710
where you were at the time of the incident

46:55.710 --> 46:57.240
and who can testify for you.

46:57.480 --> 46:58.140
What a fool!

46:58.510 --> 46:58.960
You...

46:59.710 --> 47:00.640
Stop saying you.

47:02.030 --> 47:02.880
Tea table etiquette

47:02.880 --> 47:04.230
is an essential part

47:04.230 --> 47:05.510
of Chinese tea culture.

47:04.290 --> 47:05.760
[Unacceptable]

47:05.710 --> 47:07.370
It embodies the traditional spirit
of making friends through tea

47:07.370 --> 47:09.370
and treating people with courtesy.

47:09.920 --> 47:11.410
The spout should not point at anyone.

47:11.410 --> 47:12.190
The teapot spout

47:12.190 --> 47:13.570
should face a space empty of people

47:13.570 --> 47:15.340
to avoid suggesting guests should leave.

47:15.340 --> 47:16.900
Never flip the cup lid upside down.

47:16.900 --> 47:18.630
Do not touch tea pets casually.

47:18.810 --> 47:20.020
The decorations on the tea table

47:20.020 --> 47:22.300
can only be played with
under the host's guidance.

47:22.300 --> 47:25.370
Avoid tapping cups or scraping saucers
to express dissatisfaction.

47:25.370 --> 47:27.400
Do not repeatedly fiddle with tea leaves.

47:27.400 --> 47:29.100
The first serving of tea
should not be refused.

47:29.100 --> 47:30.500
We need to repsect the tea etiquette.
